@startuml C4_Record_Executed_Operations_Logical_Deployment
title C4 – Executed Operations (Logical Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "Operator Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA\n(VVE Detail Feature)" as Spa
}

node "PLMS API Cluster" as ApiCluster {
  artifact "TodoApi Container\n(OemProxyController)" as Api
  artifact "Telemetry Agent" as Telemetry
}

cloud "Identity Platform" as Identity {
  artifact "OIDC Authority" as Oidc
}

cloud "OEM Execution Platform" as OEM {
  artifact "Executed Operations API" as OemApi
  artifact "Operational Store" as Store
}

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS (Browser)
Spa --> Api : GET/PUT /api/oem/vessel-visit-executions/.../executed-operations
Api --> Oidc : Validate tokens / cookies
Api --> OemApi : Forward OEM requests
OemApi --> Store : Read planned ops / persist executed ops
Api --> Telemetry : Emit metrics/logs

@enduml
